### Login (if needed)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
  "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Request import job (returns job record with upload key)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/imports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dataset": "employees",
  "fileKey": "uploads/hris/imports/employees-2024-01.csv",
  "clientRequestId": "req-123"
}

### Get import job status
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/imports/1

### Request export job (returns job record)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/exports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dataset": "timesheets",
  "fileKey": "exports/hris/timesheets-2024-01.csv",
  "clientRequestId": "req-456"
}

### Get export job status
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/exports/1
